  "notes": "<p>This show was night nine of Phish&#39;s Baker&#39;s Dozen run at Madison Square Garden and had&nbsp;a maple donut theme. Donuts with a maple cinnamon glaze were&nbsp;given to fans arriving at the venue. This&nbsp;show featured the Phish debuts of O Canada and Maple Leaf Rag. O Canada was&nbsp;performed as an instrumental and&nbsp;the Canadian flag in the venue was illuminated at the conclusion of the song. Maple Leaf Rag was&nbsp;performed solo&nbsp;by Page. Swept Away and Steep were last played on&nbsp;July 8, 2012&nbsp;(192 shows). 46 Days featured Trey on Marimba Lumina and Mike and Page on percussion. Trey quoted 46 Days in Piper.</p>",
